OpenCode Model Bridge

This project is a modified derivative of antigravity-add-model
(https://github.com/vahapogut/antigravity-add-model), commit
e77954b9a58e5b9408e8d3bc1cedbb5a6c456125, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The original LICENSE is retained unchanged in this repository.

Changes made in this derivative:
- Added an OpenCode (Go and Console/Zen) model picker to the desktop settings
  (src/features/opencode-picker).
- Added independent, encrypted storage of OpenCode API keys
  (src/features/opencode-connection).
- Added Antigravity 2.32+ baseLsArgs spread arguments runtime patch support
  (scripts/runtime-patch.mjs).
- Integrated both features into the settings preload and build script.
- Removed upstream example models from the initial catalog.
- Replaced the Google Antigravity logo in the README with a disclaimer.

